00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Applying.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Growing. The ThreadForge pioneer journey

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Threadforge Inc., the pioneer journey: built to stand on its own, and to evolve with you.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.800
ThreadForge Academy: learning belongs to every soul. True education is never a paywall over human potential. Courses and the practice lab are free.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:19.000
Chronological research library: sixteen original works, May to October 2026, each graded by the academy's own evidence protocol.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.800
Free tiered courses: four ranks, free forever. Apprentice, Builder, Professor, Titan.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:30.800
PWI .NET Practice Lab: five practice labs, on your own device. Every simulator runs in your browser, with no telemetry.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:37.400
For institutions: one licence for the whole institution. Your records stay with you. Nothing is sent, merged or repaired until a person approves it.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:43.200
How we work with you: four steps, and your team decides at each one. Try the demo, tell us your context, get written answers, run it yourselves.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:48.800
The Pioneer-Class Principle: "The agent stack proposes; the human disposes."

